    "sub_name": "航太材料學",
    "sub_ename": "AEROSPACE MATERIALS",
    "describe_ch": "對航太金屬/非金屬材料與製程及其選擇與應用有基本的認知，同時了解飛行載具設計與航太材料之應用關聯性，以探索材料科學與工程在航太系統工程扮演的角色。",
    "describe_eh": "Understand the basic knowledge of Aeronautical and Aerospace Materials Science. Familiarize ferrous/nonferrous alloys, advanced composites and functional materials as well as their Selection and Applications in Aeronautical and Aerospace, in order to recognize the role of Materials Engineering in the System Engineering.",
